.sbe/*
!.sbe/team-profile.json
__pycache__/
.DS_Store
# built evidence bundles are reproducible from scripts/make_evidence_bundle.sh
dist/
*.duckdb
*.parquet
*.csv

# The timestamped backups the autosave writes beside STATE.md. STATE.md itself
# is already ignored, these were not, and the gap is not cosmetic: the sibling
# repository learned it the expensive way when `git add -A` swept 477 KB of
# working state into a release manifest, including files whose own first line
# read "gitignored, not shipped".
#
# Added 2026-08-24 after BrotherSBE's scope control named four of them here as
# changes outside every declared owning path. They were written by the autosave
# at 06:58 to 07:06, by the tool rather than by any session, so no session could
# have declared them and every session gets blamed for them in turn. Ignoring
# them is the fix; deleting them is not, because they are the autosave's own
# safety net and nobody named them as disposable.
STATE.md.bak-*
# sbe init: the install receipt below records this machine's absolute path, so it stays out of git
.brothersbe/install-receipt.json
# Microsoft Office lock files (~$ prefix): created while a document is open, never content
~$*
**/~$*
